         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#covent_garden">Theatre-Royal, Covent-Garden</placeName><lb/>
               This present <date when="1811-10-04"><hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, Oct. 4, 1811</date>, will be acted the Comick Opera of<lb/>
