               <hi rend="italic">The Scenery painted by Mess. <persName ref="namedentities.xml#th_ph_scenes">Phillips</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_jo_pu">Pugh</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_he_gr">Grieve</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#j_ho">Hollogan</persName>, and their assistants.</hi><lb/>
